## Common Pitfalls

| Pitfall | How to Avoid |
|---------|--------------|
| Hand-editing `web-ng/src/app/api/` | Never. Run the generator; delete what it stops producing. |
| `session.commit()` in a route handler | Violates the adapter boundary — service layer only. |
| Importing from `providers.*` in feature modules | Use `get_provider()` exclusively. |
| Hard-coding route paths in the contract matrix | Derive from `app.url_map` at collection time. |
| Class-name selectors in E2E | Use `[data-test]` exclusively. |
| Per-test server restart in E2E | Session-scoped fixture only. |
| `--cov-fail-under` in CI | Documented lesson: thresholds get gamed. Artifact + trend instead. |
| `except Exception` without logging | Always `app.logger.exception(...)` before returning the envelope. |

